{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "residential_damaged_records",
  "spec": ["residential 9.2", "residential 5.5", "RS9", "RS11", "RS14", "RS15", "EH14"],
  "description": "residential 9.2: a damaged record makes Read return false and leaves the class store's new simulator as constructed, releasing the department references it took (RS9 [choice]): a coverage vector count other than 7 (school, offset 66) or 3 (hospital, offset 126), a building-list vector count other than 7 (offset 357) or 3 (offset 389) (RS11), a saved state above 15 (offset 230, RS14), or a population tract size P (offset 30) or EQ tract size E (offset 170) outside 1...256 read as signed (RS15, EH14 [choice]: the original keeps them unchecked; 0 and every negative value are rejected). State 15, P = 256 and E = 256 are read.",
